# Part 2 scans: 40 MB added on top of part 1 (41 MB) exceeds the 50 MB budget,
# so the new page images stay out of Git. Text artefacts reference them by name.
# Parts 2–4: p022–p124 stay out of Git for the same reason (part 3 is another
# ~39 MB, part 4 another ~12 MB). The archived JPEGs are reproducible from
# the uploaded fragments / archive.
raw/scans/p0[23456789]*.jpg
raw/scans/p1[0-2]*.jpg
